==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Snache]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Snache]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Snache]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that only really requires the Normal Cats. If one is worried about the Metal Hippoe, [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]] (the first critical hitter you likely will unlock) will suffice.

